PluginReactLynxOptions.customCSSInherita.en:
By setting `customCSSInheritanceList: ['direction', 'overflow']`, only the `direction` and `overflow` properties are inheritable.

```ts
// rsbuild.config.ts
import { pluginReactLynx } from '@lynx-js/react-rsbuild-plugin'
import { defineConfig } from '@rsbuild/core'

export default defineConfig({
 environments: { lynx: {} },
 plugins: [
   pluginReactLynx({
     enableCSSInheritance: true,
     customCSSInheritanceList: ['direction', 'overflow']
   }),
 ],
})
```

PluginReactLynxOptions.customCSSInherita.text:
设置 `customCSSInheritanceList: ['direction', 'overflow']` 后，只有 `direction` 和 `overflow` 属性可继承。

```ts
// rsbuild.config.ts
import { pluginReactLynx } from '@lynx-js/react-rsbuild-plugin'
import { defineConfig } from '@rsbuild/core'

export default defineConfig({
 environments: { lynx: {} },
 plugins: [
   pluginReactLynx({
     enableCSSInheritance: true,
     customCSSInheritanceList: ['direction', 'overflow']
   }),
 ],
})
```
